ARASAAC pictograms
------------------
Prism AAC displays pictograms from the ARASAAC collection. They are retrieved at
runtime from api.arasaac.org and static.arasaac.org and cached only on the end
user's device. They are not redistributed with this software, are not modified,
and are not included in any distributed package.

    Author of the pictograms: Sergio Palao
    Origin: ARASAAC (https://arasaac.org)
    Licence: CC (BY-NC-SA)
    Owner: Government of Aragon (Spain)

The ARASAAC Pictogram Collection is registered in the Spanish General Registry
of Intellectual Property (Legal Deposit Z 901-2013) as a collective work of the
Diputación General de Aragón. "ARASAAC" is a trademark of the Government of
Aragon, registered with the Spanish Patent and Trademark Office.

Note on the NonCommercial term: the CC BY-NC-SA licence excludes commercial use.
Prism AAC offers an optional paid subscription covering cloud speech synthesis
and AI assistance only; the pictograms are shown free of charge to every user,
including those who never subscribe, and form no part of the paid offering.
Synalux LLC does not treat this as settling the question, and has approached the
rights holder for express authorisation.

